                "markdown": "> Passing a heavily nested list to sqlparse.parse() leads to a Denial of Service due to RecursionError.\n\n|                                                                                                        |\n|Package                                                                        pkg:pypi/sqlparse@0.3.1  |\n|Affected range                                                                 <0.5.0                   |\n|Fixed version                                                                  0.5.0                    |\n|[[CVSS Score 7.5] [CVSS Vector CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H]]                           |\n"
