              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2023-4863?s=github&n=pillow&t=pypi&vr=%3C10.0.1",
              "help": {
                "text": "Heap buffer overflow in libwebp allow a remote attacker to perform an out of bounds memory write via a crafted HTML page.\n",
